      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I'm so impressed. I can learn Japanese here, too! \nI didn't know 自家（じか）薬籠中(やくろうちゆう)の物(もの) . This comes from Chinese history book of Tang.",
